<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><rdf:RDF xmlns:cc="http://creativecommons.org/ns#" xmlns:dct="http://purl.org/dc/terms/" xmlns:adms="http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#" xmlns:foaf="http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/" xmlns:odrl="http://www.w3.org/ns/odrl/2/" xmlns:owl="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#" xmlns:dcat="http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#" xmlns:lcon="http://www.w3.org/ns/locn#" xmlns:sioc="http://rdfs.org/sioc/ns#" xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#" xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" xmlns:prov="http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#" xmlns:skos="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xmlns:schema="http://schema.org/" xmlns:v="http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#" xmlns:vann="http://purl.org/vocab/vann/" xmlns:voaf="http://purl.org/vocommons/voaf#" xmlns:wdrs="http://www.w3.org/2007/05/powder-s#" xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#" xmlns:spdx="http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#" xmlns:time="http://www.w3.org/2006/time#" xmlns:dcatap="http://data.europa.eu/r5r/" xmlns:stat="http://data.europa.eu/s1n/statdcat-ap/" xmlns:qb="http://purl.org/linked-data/cube#" ><dcat:Dataset rdf:about="http://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/web/products-datasets/-/tipsbp49"><dct:issued rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2015-04-20</dct:issued><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="de">Zahlungsbilanz Position</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="en">Balance of payments item</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="fr">Poste de la balance des paiements</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="de">Währung</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="en">Currency</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="fr">Monnaie</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="de">Zeitliche Frequenz</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="en">Time frequency</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="fr">Fréquence (relative au temps)</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="de">Geopolitische Meldeeinheit</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="en">Geopolitical entity (reporting)</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="fr">Entité géopolitique (déclarante)</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="de">Geopolitische Partnereinheit</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="en">Geopolitical entity (partner)</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="fr">Entité géopolitique (partenaire)</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="de">Sektor (ESVG 2010)</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="en">Sector (ESA 2010)</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="fr">Secteur (SEC 2010)</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="de">Sektor des Transaktionspartners (ESVG 2010)</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="en">Counterpart sector (ESA 2010)</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="fr">Secteur de contrepartie (SEC 2010)</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="de">Bestand oder Fluss</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="en">Stock or flow</dcat:keyword><dcat:keyword  xml:lang="fr">Stock ou flux</dcat:keyword><dct:type><skos:Concept  rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/dataset-type/STATISTICAL"/></dct:type><dct:title xml:lang="en">Financial account, main components - quarterly data, million units of national currency</dct:title><dct:description xml:lang="en">The Financial account records transactions that involve financial assets and liabilities that have taken place between residents and non-residents. The financial account shows transactions in net terms: net acquisitions of financial assets correspond to gross acquisitions of assets less gross sales of assets; net incurrence of liabilites corresponds to gross incurrence of liabilites less gross decrease in liabilites. According to the functional sub-division cross-border financial transactions and positions are classified as Direct investment, Portfolio investment, Financial derivatives (other than reserves) and employee stock options, Other investment, and Reserve assets. Cross-border financial transactions and positions are further classified by type of instrument and institutional sector. The financial account together with the current and capital accounts forms the Balance of Payments (BoP). The data are expressed in million units of national currency. The indicator is based on the Balance of Payments (BoP) data reported to Eurostat by the EU Member States. Starting from October 2014 definitions are based on the IMF&apos;s Sixth Balance of Payments Manual (BPM6).</dct:description><dct:title xml:lang="fr">Compte financier, principales composantes - données trimestrielles, millions d&apos;unités monétaires nationales</dct:title><dct:description xml:lang="fr">Le compte financier enregistre les opérations mobilisant des actifs et des passifs financiers effectuées entre résidents et non-résidents. Ce compte fait apparaître les transactions en termes nets: les acquisitions nettes d’actifs financiers correspondent aux acquisitions brutes d’actifs, moins les cessions brutes d’actifs; l&apos;accroissement net des passifs correspond à l&apos;accroissement brut moins la diminution brute des passifs. Conformément à la subdivision fonctionnelle, les transactions et positions financières internationales sont classées comme investissements directs, investissements de portefeuille, produits financiers dérivés (autres que réserves) et options sur titres des salariés, autres investissements, et avoirs de réserve. Les transactions et positions financières internationales sont également classées par type d&apos;instrument et par secteur institutionnel. Le compte financier, le compte des opérations courantes et le compte de capital constituent la balance des paiements. Les données sont exprimées en millions d&apos;unités monétaires nationales. L&apos;indicateur est établi sur la base des données de la balance des paiements transmises à Eurostat par les États membres de l&apos;UE. À compter d&apos;octobre 2014, les définitions utilisées seront fondées sur le 6e manuel de la balance des paiements (MBP6).</dct:description><dct:title xml:lang="de">Finanzierungskonto, Hauptkomponenten - vierteljährliche Daten, Millionen Landeswährung</dct:title><dct:description xml:lang="de">Das Finanzierungskonto erfasst Transaktionen in Bezug auf finanzielle Forderungen und Verbindlichkeiten zwischen Gebietsansässigen und Gebietsfremden. Die Transaktionen werden als Nettobeträge ausgewiesen: Der Nettozugang an finanziellen Aktiva entspricht dem Bruttoerwerb an Aktiva abzüglich der Bruttoveräußerung von Aktiva; der Nettozugang an Verbindlichkeiten entspricht der Bruttoaufnahme von Verbindlichkeiten abzüglich des Bruttorückgangs der Verbindlichkeiten. Im Rahmen der funktionalen Gliederung werden grenzüberschreitende finanzielle Transaktionen und Positionen in Direktinvestitionen, Wertpapieranlagen, Finanzderivate (ohne Währungsreserven) und Mitarbeiteraktienoptionen, Übriger Kapitalverkehr und Währungsreserven unterteilt. Grenzüberschreitende finanzielle Transaktionen und Positionen werden außerdem nach Instrumentenkategorien und institutionellen Sektoren untergliedert. Das Finanzierungskonto bildet zusammen mit der Leistungs- und der Kapitalbilanz die Zahlungsbilanz. Ausgedrückt wird das Finanzierungskonto in Mio. Landeswährung. Der Indikator basiert auf den Zahlungsbilanzdaten, die Eurostat von den EU-Mitgliedstaaten gemeldet werden. Ab Oktober 2014 beruhen die entsprechenden Definitionen auf der sechsten Auflage des Zahlungsbilanzhandbuchs (Balance of Payments Manual – BPM 6).</dct:description><dct:identifier>tipsbp49</dct:identifier><foaf:page rdf:resource="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/databrowser/product/page/tipsbp49"/><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/BEL"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/BGR"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/CZE"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/DNK"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/DEU"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/EST"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/IRL"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/GRC"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/ESP"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/FRA"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/HRV"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/ITA"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/CYP"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/LVA"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/LTU"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/LUX"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/HUN"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/MLT"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/NLD"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/AUT"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/POL"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/PRT"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/ROU"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/SVN"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/SVK"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/FIN"/></dct:spatial><dct:spatial><dct:Location rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/country/SWE"/></dct:spatial><stat:dimension> <qb:DimensionProperty rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/BOP_ITEM" > <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="de">Zahlungsbilanz Position</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Balance of payments item</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="fr">Poste de la balance des paiements</skos:prefLabel> </qb:DimensionProperty> </stat:dimension><stat:dimension> <qb:DimensionProperty rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/CURRENCY" > <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="de">Währung</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Currency</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="fr">Monnaie</skos:prefLabel> </qb:DimensionProperty> </stat:dimension><stat:dimension> <qb:DimensionProperty rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/FREQ" > <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="de">Zeitliche Frequenz</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Time frequency</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="fr">Fréquence (relative au temps)</skos:prefLabel> </qb:DimensionProperty> </stat:dimension><stat:dimension> <qb:DimensionProperty rdf:about="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/api/dissemination/sdmx/2.1/codelist/ESTAT/GEO" > <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="de">Geopolitische Meldeeinheit</skos:prefLabel><skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Geopolitical entity (reporting)</skos:prefLa